                            },
                            {
                              "options": [
                                {
                                  "label": "Is everything okay?",
                                  "commands": [
                                    {
                                      "text": "Yes! Everything is... fine. Laura, she... she liked the gift. I think. She's wearing it. Under her apron, so no one else can see. It's... nice. Thank you, again. For helping me.",
