                                      "cmd": "CHOICE"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "label": "It's nice to see you out.",
                                  "commands": [
                                    {
                                      "text": "Thank you. It's... a little loud. But the tea is good. It's nice to just... sit for a moment. And not worry about what needs restocking.",
